<title>USA: Morgan Group qtly divs on class A and B.</title>
<headline>Morgan Group qtly divs on class A and B.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Group Inc declared a quarterly dividend of $0.02 per share of Class A common stock.</p>
<p>					    Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.02		     $0.02</p>
<p> Pay		    Jan 20</p>
<p> Record		  Jan 6</p>
<p>----</p>
<p>Morgan Group Inc declared a quarterly dividend of $0.01 per share of Class B common stock.</p>
<p>					    Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.01		     $0.01</p>
<p> Pay		    Jan 20</p>
<p> Record		  Jan 6</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is The Morgan Group Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
